00:17:27.369 --> 00:17:33.170
That is intuitive,
efficient, and convenient.

00:17:33.170 --> 00:17:36.940
So what I mean by
intuitive is we make sure

00:17:36.940 --> 00:17:40.690
that our web shop experience
or our shopping experience

00:17:40.690 --> 00:17:42.740
is very easy to use.

00:17:42.740 --> 00:17:46.150
So anything we build
has to be easy to use.

00:17:46.150 --> 00:17:52.350
It has to be immediately
accessible by our customers.

00:17:52.350 --> 00:17:53.460
Efficient.

00:17:53.460 --> 00:17:57.420
So because we need to do
things fast and a lot of things

00:17:57.420 --> 00:18:02.280
at scale, like picking orders,
packing them, delivering them,

00:18:02.280 --> 00:18:06.480
sorting them, all kinds of
these operational processes,

00:18:06.480 --> 00:18:10.060
along the whole end-to-end,
we need to be efficient.

00:18:10.060 --> 00:18:13.510
So we effectively need
to be efficient at scale.

00:18:13.510 --> 00:18:15.010
And I've got a video
actually, where

00:18:15.010 --> 00:18:17.910
