our latest warehouses

00:18:17.910 --> 00:18:21.090
and how we are building
robots to help us be

00:18:21.090 --> 00:18:24.290
more automated and efficient.

00:18:24.290 --> 00:18:26.060
And then, convenient.

00:18:26.060 --> 00:18:30.110
Well, I have a picture of
one of our delivery drivers.

00:18:30.110 --> 00:18:32.510
And what this really
means is we need

00:18:32.510 --> 00:18:36.170
to build software and
applications that are not

00:18:36.170 --> 00:18:40.430
just great, and fast, and
out there in the market,

00:18:40.430 --> 00:18:45.220
and quickly in the hands of
our customers, and innovative.

00:18:45.220 --> 00:18:49.100
They need to be convenient,
easy to use, easy

00:18:49.100 --> 00:18:52.320
