00:19:03.480 --> 00:19:05.750
So the technology
needs to work for them,

00:19:05.750 --> 00:19:07.880
to allow them to do their job.

00:19:07.880 --> 00:19:09.830
And that's one of
our principles,

00:19:09.830 --> 00:19:13.850
