00:19:25.870 --> 00:19:29.410
skills, a lot of capabilities.

00:19:29.410 --> 00:19:32.830
And what Ocado has
done over the years--

00:19:32.830 --> 00:19:34.660
actually, since the start--

00:19:34.660 --> 00:19:37.510
has invested in
these departments.

00:19:37.510 --> 00:19:40.090
We have a lot of
people who are working

00:19:40.090 --> 00:19:42.220
