00:19:42.220 --> 00:19:45.940
We have specialists in
machine learning, mobile app

00:19:45.940 --> 00:19:50.350
development, routing
systems, data science, Cloud,

00:19:50.350 --> 00:19:52.930
vision systems, simulation.

00:19:52.930 --> 00:19:55.870
I mean, if you walk around
