00:20:07.180 --> 00:20:13.990
Just to talk to
Nick's point, for us,

00:20:13.990 --> 00:20:19.610
we need to invest heavily in
skills like machine learning

00:20:19.610 --> 00:20:24.610
and basically how to use Cloud
technologies, which prompts

