00:20:32.320 --> 00:20:35.530
the next step, which
is keeping innovative,

00:20:35.530 --> 00:20:39.060
keeping on the bleeding edge,
offering those new systems,

00:20:39.060 --> 00:20:42.310
building those intelligent
personalized experiences.

00:20:42.310 --> 00:20:43.960
And that's where we want to be.

00:20:43.960 --> 00:20:48.430
So as a business,
